OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with spells of rain
OL,6,Ftoday, heavy at times with a risk of
OL,7,Fthunder. Some drier and possibly
OL,8,Fbrighter interludes in the far south.
OL,9,FFeeling chilly in the far north.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers easing for a time
OL,12,Fthis evening, but turning cloudier
OL,13,Fagain overnight with a band of heavier
OL,14,Frain moving through and persisting
OL,15,Finto dawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FA generally cloudy day with
OL,18,Foutbreaks of rain and showers
OL,19,Fthroughout. A risk of thunder at times
OL,20,Fassociated with heavier showers and
OL,21,Fhail.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
