OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Friday, clearing into the afternoon
OL,7,Fand becoming colder with widespread
OL,8,Ffrosts overnight. Saturday generally
OL,9,Ffine and dry, clouding over later with
OL,10,Fa risk of rain on Sunday.
